{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game is the first project developed with passion by a three-person independent team. Combining our imagination, effort, and time, we\u2019ve created a world where you must survive in a realm ruled by darkness.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crystal Effect: Elemental</strong> invites you into a magical land engulfed in shadow. Protect the core crystal, build your village, and defend against the threats that emerge when night falls.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2728 Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Protect the core crystal to keep the world alive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategize using elemental crystals, each with unique powers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own city and increase your people's happiness to thrive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for enemy waves that arrive with the night.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage resources, set up defenses, and preserve the crystal\u2019s energy!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the sun sets, hope fades and darkness creeps in. Your courage will shape the fate of your people.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3734790?t=1752581317","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3734790?t=1752581317","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734790/32ffc9ea32fb9d3bdcf0f8612aa9b8a120a43121/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752581317","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734790/32ffc9ea32fb9d3bdcf0f8612aa9b8a120a43121/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752581317","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game is the first project dev